# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# RoseCentre .gitignore
#
# Principle: git tracks CODE and REASONING (.Rmd, .R, CLAUDE.md,
# ANALYSIS_PLAN.md, MANUSCRIPT.md, README.md). Data and anything
# regenerable from code stays in OneDrive, out of git.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Data ----------------------------------------------------
# Size, and often participant-confidential. OneDrive holds these.
**/data/raw/**
**/data/processed/**
**/data/interim/**
**/data/original/**

*.csv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.sav
*.dta
*.rds
*.parquet

# --- R session state -----------------------------------------
# Hidden state is the enemy of reproducibility: every .Rmd must
# run from a clean session.
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# --- Rendered / regenerable output ----------------------------
# Regenerable from src/. Keeping them out avoids diff noise and
# avoids two copies drifting apart.
*.html
*_cache/

# knitr/rmarkdown asset directories. Deliberately NOT a blanket `*_files/`:
# Maddie's CNV_reliability_analysis_files/ had been repurposed to hold real
# .Rmd/.R/.csv/.xlsx source, and a blanket rule hid it from the 2026-08-04
# baseline commit entirely. Match the generated subdirectories instead, so a
# `_files/` folder containing actual source still shows up in `git status`.
**/*_files/figure-html/
**/*_files/figure-latex/
**/*_files/figure-gfm/
**/*_files/figure-markdown*/
**/*_files/libs/
**/*_files/*.html
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md
Rplots.pdf

# Figures and rendered reports. Binary, don't diff, and every one
# is regenerable from the .Rmd that git DOES track.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tiff
*.svg
*.pdf

# LaTeX intermediates
*.aux
*.log
*.synctex.gz
*.out
*.toc

# --- Manuscripts ---------------------------------------------
# git cannot diff Word usefully. Version history lives in
# manuscript/drafts/ filenames and OneDrive.
*.docx
*.doc

# --- Scratch --------------------------------------------------
scratch/
tmp_*
temp_*
*.tmp

# Extensionless PNG dumped by a bare R plot() call
**/plot

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Secrets --------------------------------------------------
.env
*.key

# --- Claude Code ----------------------------------------------
# The shared harness moved up to EGH_analytics/ on 2026-08-10 and is
# versioned in the repo there -- skills/, agents/ and templates/ are
# no longer in this repository. What remains here is a fallback
# settings.json for anyone who opens RoseCentre/ directly.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- OS -------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- Exceptions ----------------------------------------------
# Each project's research questions + hypotheses. Small, and it
# defines the project's scope, so it IS versioned despite *.xlsx.
# git can't diff it usefully -- the reasoning belongs in the
# ANALYSIS_PLAN.md files, which are diffable.
!**/RESEARCH_QUESTIONS.xlsx

# Other small reference tables worth versioning can be force-added:
#   git add -f path/to/file.csv

# --- data and outputs never enter git (added 2026-11-10) ---
.claude/worktrees/
**/outputs/
**/data/**
!**/data/**/
!**/data/**/README.md
!**/data/**/*.R
!**/data/**/*.r
*.csv
*.sav
*.rds
*.RData
*.rda
*.dta
*.mat
*.wav
*.xls
*.xlsx
!**/RESEARCH_QUESTIONS*.xlsx
Figure_prevalence_files/
